NATURE

1. Nature gives us fresh air to breathe.

2. Trees provide oxygen and help reduce air pollution.

3. Forests are home to many animals, birds, and insects.

4. Rivers and lakes provide water for people, animals, and plants.

5. Plants help maintain the balance of the environment.

6. Rain is important for plants, animals, and human life.

7. Mountains are important natural resources and support many ecosystems.

8. Wildlife plays an important role in maintaining ecological balance.

9. We should avoid cutting trees unnecessarily.

10. We should keep our surroundings clean and reduce plastic waste.

11. Planting more trees can help make the Earth greener.
